{{Quote|I'll give you the benefit of the doubt being you're not from around here and say you're figured you're in the middle of nowhere. But everything out there to everything out there is the Mos Pelgos territories.|Marshal Cobb Vanth, to Pykes|<ref name="Chapter 6" />}}
The '''Mos Pelgo territories''' was a region on [[Tatooine]] that contained the [[City|town]] of Mos Pelgo, which the townspeople renamed [[Freetown]]. [[Marshal]] [[Cobb Vanth]] confronted [[Pyke Syndicate]] members in the region.<ref name="Chapter 6" />
